  {"headline":"Israel-Hamas ceasefire talks stall as violence spikes in Gaza","summary":"Negotiations in Cairo failed to produce a lasting truce as rocket fire and Israeli airstrikes intensified over the weekend, raising fears of a broader regional escalation.","source":"BBC News"},
  {"headline":"Sudan's paramilitary RSF claims control of key oil fields in South Kordofan","summary":"The Rapid Support Forces announced they seized several oil-producing facilities, worsening the humanitarian crisis and threatening the country's fragile economy amid ongoing civil war.","source":"Reuters"},
